          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$\\hat{p}_1 = 320/400 = 0.8$, $\\hat{p}_2 = 210/300 = 0.7$, so $\\hat{p}_1 - \\hat{p}_2 = 0.1$. The standard error is $\\sqrt{\\frac{0.8(0.2)}{400}+\\frac{0.7(0.3)}{300}} = \\sqrt{0.0004+0.0007} = \\sqrt{0.0011} = 0.03317$. Margin $= 1.96 \\times 0.03317 = 0.06501$, giving $0.1 \\pm 0.065 = (0.035, 0.165)$, which rounds to $(0.03, 0.17)$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$\\hat{p}_1 = 320/400 = 0.8$, $\\hat{p}_2 = 210/300 = 0.7$, nên $\\hat{p}_1 - \\hat{p}_2 = 0.1$. Sai số chuẩn là $\\sqrt{\\frac{0.8(0.2)}{400}+\\frac{0.7(0.3)}{300}} = \\sqrt{0.0004+0.0007} = \\sqrt{0.0011} = 0.03317$. Biên $= 1.96 \\times 0.03317 = 0.06501$, cho $0.1 \\pm 0.065 = (0.035, 0.165)$, làm tròn thành $(0.03, 0.17)$.</p></div>"
