          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Two equations. Total probability: $0.1+0.2+a+b+0.2 = 1 \\Rightarrow a+b = 0.5$. Mean: $0(0.1)+1(0.2)+2a+3b+4(0.2) = 2.2 \\Rightarrow 2a+3b = 1.2$. Substituting $a = 0.5-b$ gives $2(0.5-b)+3b = 1+b = 1.2$, so $b = 0.2$ and $a = 0.3$. Therefore $a+3b = 0.3 + 0.6 = 0.90$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Hai phương trình. Tổng xác suất: $0.1+0.2+a+b+0.2 = 1 \\Rightarrow a+b = 0.5$. Trung bình: $0(0.1)+1(0.2)+2a+3b+4(0.2) = 2.2 \\Rightarrow 2a+3b = 1.2$. Thế $a = 0.5-b$ được $2(0.5-b)+3b = 1+b = 1.2$, nên $b = 0.2$ và $a = 0.3$. Do đó $a+3b = 0.3 + 0.6 = 0.90$.</p></div>"
